            <div xml:id="m-f063ab15-be99-4dc3-a0b3-0bce8fbabf33">
              <lg xml:id="m-390d44de-d17e-4b6e-b410-d7ee47807bbd">
                <l xml:id="m-1245a8db-f8ac-414f-9637-dbf2dec4dd7e" facs="#m-a1aa2423-22a1-4fd5-b61e-756c12eddda7" label="text-like">1102 Commemorations of the Sunday or of the Feria.</l><l xml:id="m-d3e8f9c9-1c15-4ee2-acae-993ef132cec5" facs="#m-4a11d01c-8c2f-4ea2-aa37-d6cf719bcd4c" label="lyrics-like">cávit múltos: et mí- sit sérvum sú-um hó-ra coé-nae</l><l xml:id="m-60c2f6e5-d1fd-4e6b-a22f-b8c6185bf07f" facs="#m-f6e6384c-0302-455e-b711-bedd5de4c364" label="lyrics-like">di-ce-re invi-tá-tis ut veni-rent, qui-a ómni¬ a pará-ta</l><l xml:id="m-0486d022-20c8-4af5-a634-d50ebc146854" facs="#m-df14739e-0f72-4740-87fc-bccbe2752022" label="lyrics-like">sunt, alle-lú¬ia.</l><l xml:id="m-b25294f8-aac2-4ebb-8470-dad4976607b0" facs="#m-7602794e-6e8c-4326-a88c-98d3f35dc482" label="lyrics-like">v. Pánem caéli dédit éis, allelúia.</l><l xml:id="m-4bea821a-551b-421b-93aa-8af523266977" facs="#m-753e44e9-c4c7-4c7f-9293-5b9f5b0ab703" label="lyrics-like">R. Pánem Angelórum manducávit hómo, allelúia.</l><l xml:id="m-95b9af51-addb-427d-aa31-05f3f28733b2" facs="#m-6e4c1952-e64f-4a94-87e9-588d223eb4ff" label="text-like">Prayer of that Sunday.</l><l xml:id="m-48c76a00-0638-4c75-a789-d0093e63d91c" facs="#m-32569350-69a5-4525-b73d-a808ba440b3d" label="text-like">The Third Sunday after Pentecost.</l><l xml:id="m-1cadeb99-e29f-4dbd-86f3-6280a229079c" facs="#m-29e4362c-5e0d-4bf0-a62a-c30365be9682" label="text-like">At Lauds. E</l><l xml:id="m-a0159300-d538-4551-ac8e-d83c5ed6e5bb" facs="#m-7325be5d-3172-47c8-a487-c9a0a6954951" label="ambiguous">Ant. 3.</l><l xml:id="m-8ea8d2d5-6a4d-4a4e-98fe-2fac3a8242b2" facs="#m-252fc498-78b2-4249-abe9-80aef8e7c985" label="ambiguous">0</l><l xml:id="m-5f694047-b952-4ccc-916a-bb5b044e94ed" facs="#m-4617d11e-a7de-400b-9060-efc06174d5e9" label="lyrics-like">Uis ex vóbis hómo,  qui hábet centum óves,</l><l xml:id="m-41fc02df-6123-4a8c-be14-4187de2c28e1" facs="#m-4239a888-9090-4af6-a5c4-392d0f7628fa" label="lyrics-like">et si perdíde-rit únam ex fl-lis, nonne dimíttit nona¬</l><l xml:id="m-8175463e-787c-43df-b154-8c15d9b1860a" facs="#m-d74e3075-606c-4bbd-b220-738263aa454a" label="lyrics-like">gínta no-vem in de-sérto, et vádit ad illam quae per-i¬e</l><l xml:id="m-13fd0f07-99a9-4c05-9ef8-41a60bf5cb99" facs="#m-b87214f2-e250-4e7a-86cf-c317ff707e19" label="lyrics-like">rat, donec invéni-at é-am? alle- lú¬ ia</l><l xml:id="m-286f7fed-3ea3-43fa-a1b5-6e66f814a938" facs="#m-c557d575-eefc-4607-be62-6d4114545649" label="lyrics-like">v. Memóriam fécit mirabilium suórum miserátor Dóminus.</l><l xml:id="m-0cc6c5f3-6131-46ec-b7de-e100e87a692d" facs="#m-93c9bf24-52e5-43ef-b4f0-e0b6290e5e81" label="lyrics-like">R. Escam dédit timéntibus se.</l><l xml:id="m-53d86209-eb86-49dc-9d34-1de473f202e7" facs="#m-4b1f239d-ab8f-4ec6-9b7d-3913ec351198" label="text-like">Prayer of that Sunday.</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>